  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1\tThe proposed conversion of the property which has an original floor area of less then 120m2, for use as two two-bedroom flats at 13 Maswell Park Gardens, Hounslow, incorporating a single storey rear and roof extension, would result in the loss of a family sized house, for which there is high demand in the borough. The intensity of the use is inappropriate in its location, which is predominantly single-family units and unacceptably affects the residential character of the street This is contrary to Policy 4B.8 of the London Plan, Policy ENV-B.1.1 (New Development), H.3.4 (Conversions of Houses to Flats) and H.4.1 (Housing Standards and Guidelines) of the London Borough of Hounslow Unitary Development Plan (2003) and Supplementary Planning Guidance (1997).",
